The generator now passes all local gates on its first full run. At the shipping preset, the exact fixed-weight answer space is about 466 bits, random guessing hit 0/200,000, all four no-tool attacks were 0/8, and generic forward substitution solved 8/8 using 16,773,120 GF(2) operations in about 0.44 seconds. The largest answer found in a 1,000-seed sweep is 806 characters / 128 atomic elements; the compact complementary-factor route is 86 exact operations.
